; The exports of user32.dll (ReactOS 0.4.16, i386) that the Win32 test
; programs call, for their import library (`cargo xtask` builds it with
; dlltool --kill-at). stdcall functions carry their argument bytes (@N); the
; DLL exports them undecorated.
LIBRARY user32.dll
EXPORTS
CreateDesktopW@24
CreateWindowExW@48
CreateWindowStationW@16
DefWindowProcW@16
GetClassInfoExW@12
GetClientRect@8
GetMonitorInfoW@8
GetParent@4
GetSysColor@4
GetSystemMetrics@4
GetWindow@8
GetWindowLongW@8
GetWindowRect@8
GetWindowTextW@12
IsWindow@4
IsWindowVisible@4
MonitorFromPoint@12
MonitorFromWindow@8
MoveWindow@24
RegisterClassExW@4
RegisterLogonProcess@8
SetProcessWindowStation@4
SetThreadDesktop@4
SetWindowPos@28
SetWindowTextW@8
SwitchDesktop@4
